    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i just had a nasty trip on the sidewalk and banged my head pretty hard. i'm feeling super dizzy and the brightness from my screen is making my eyes feel really sensitive. i can't really leave work right now though, any quick ways to fix the dizziness so i can keep working?",
